DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260805T193000
SUMMARY:Nine and Dine at Chestnut Mountain Golf Course
DESCRIPTION:Asheville Singles Over 50 Golf Meetup\n**Nine of holes of golf
  with dinner afterwards.**\n**Organizer will notify attendees if weather w
 ill cause delays or cancellation.**\n**Members of this Meetup who have not
  joined the American Singles Golf Association (ASGA) can attend up to thre
 e events and then decide whether or not to join. The total of three events
  also includes the outings posted on the** [Asheville ASGA website](www.as
 heville.singlesgolf.com) **.**\n**Please arrive early so we can tee off no
  later than 4:30pm.**\n**Organizer will notify attendees if there is a wea
 ther delay or cancellation.**
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/asheville-singles-golf/events/3157135
 54/
